1
00:00:02,051 --> 00:00:03,461
Welcome to The Expanse,

2
00:00:03,481 --> 00:00:04,636
season one.

3
00:00:04,656 --> 00:00:06,536
It's the twenty-third century.

4
00:00:06,556 --> 00:00:08,861
Earth is crowded and powerful.

5
00:00:08,881 --> 00:00:11,171
Mars is a young military power,

6
00:00:11,191 --> 00:00:14,116
slowly turning its red deserts green.

7
00:00:14,226 --> 00:00:16,281
And Belters mine the asteroids,

8
00:00:16,301 --> 00:00:18,231
tired of being pushed around.

9
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:20,331
Nobody trusts anybody.

10
00:00:20,351 --> 00:00:22,256
Three stories start far apart,

11
00:00:22,276 --> 00:00:23,026
and by the end,

12
00:00:23,046 --> 00:00:24,201
they collide.

13
00:00:24,221 --> 00:00:25,499
Spoilers ahead!

14
00:00:26,248 --> 00:00:28,333
Story one: the Canterbury.

15
00:00:28,353 --> 00:00:30,083
Jim Holden is an officer on an

16
00:00:30,103 --> 00:00:32,718
ice hauler, carrying water from Saturn's rings

17
00:00:32,738 --> 00:00:34,993
to thirsty stations in the Belt.

18
00:00:35,013 --> 00:00:37,193
Out here, water is life.

19
00:00:37,213 --> 00:00:39,228
One day, the crew answers a distress

20
00:00:39,248 --> 00:00:40,853
call from a drifting ship called the

21
00:00:40,873 --> 00:00:42,028
Scopuli.

22
00:00:42,048 --> 00:00:43,303
It's a trap.

23
00:00:43,323 --> 00:00:45,403
Mystery ships destroy the Canterbury,

24
00:00:45,423 --> 00:00:47,481
and only five people escape in a

25
00:00:47,501 --> 00:00:49,553
shuttle: Holden, Naomi,

26
00:00:49,573 --> 00:00:51,554
Amos, Alex, and Shed.

27
00:00:52,281 --> 00:00:54,161
Holden finds a Martian part on the

28
00:00:54,181 --> 00:00:56,236
trap and blames Mars on an open

29
00:00:56,256 --> 00:00:58,911
broadcast, and the Belt erupts.

30
00:00:58,931 --> 00:00:59,886
A Martian warship,

31
00:00:59,906 --> 00:01:01,606
the Donnager, picks them up,

32
00:01:01,626 --> 00:01:03,881
then gets destroyed by the same stealthy

33
00:01:03,901 --> 00:01:04,806
ships.

34
00:01:04,826 --> 00:01:06,806
The crew escapes in a small Martian

35
00:01:06,826 --> 00:01:08,081
ship, the Tachi,

36
00:01:08,101 --> 00:01:10,456
and renames it the Rocinante.

37
00:01:10,476 --> 00:01:11,981
At Tycho Station,

38
00:01:12,001 --> 00:01:14,741
Fred Johnson of the Outer Planets Alliance,

39
00:01:14,761 --> 00:01:17,631
the OPA, helps them start hunting for

40
00:01:17,651 --> 00:01:18,520
answers.

41
00:01:19,269 --> 00:01:21,294
Story two: Ceres.

42
00:01:21,314 --> 00:01:23,369
Detective Joe Miller is a Belter cop

43
00:01:23,389 --> 00:01:24,869
with a battered hat and a side

44
00:01:24,889 --> 00:01:26,819
job: find Julie Mao,

45
00:01:26,839 --> 00:01:28,669
the runaway daughter of a rich Earth

46
00:01:28,689 --> 00:01:29,719
family.

47
00:01:29,739 --> 00:01:31,094
Ceres is crowded,

48
00:01:31,114 --> 00:01:32,339
thirsty, and tense,

49
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:34,034
and Miller has seen it all.

50
00:01:34,074 --> 00:01:35,424
But the deeper he digs,

51
00:01:35,444 --> 00:01:37,274
the stranger it gets.

52
00:01:37,294 --> 00:01:39,049
Julie was on the Scopuli,

53
00:01:39,069 --> 00:01:40,624
the same ship that lured in the

54
00:01:40,644 --> 00:01:41,874
Canterbury.

55
00:01:41,894 --> 00:01:43,224
Miller won't drop the case,

56
00:01:43,244 --> 00:01:44,884
so his boss fires him.

57
00:01:45,589 --> 00:01:48,624
Miller follows Julie's trail to Eros,

58
00:01:48,644 --> 00:01:50,249
a station in the Belt that's home

59
00:01:50,269 --> 00:01:52,224
to about a hundred thousand people,

60
00:01:52,244 --> 00:01:54,874
and runs straight into Holden's crew.

61
00:01:54,894 --> 00:01:56,774
The cynic and the idealist make an

62
00:01:56,794 --> 00:01:57,999
odd pair.

63
00:01:58,019 --> 00:01:59,544
Together they find Julie,

64
00:01:59,564 --> 00:02:00,894
but too late.

65
00:02:00,914 --> 00:02:03,294
She was infected by something alien,

66
00:02:03,314 --> 00:02:05,139
the protomolecule.

67
00:02:05,249 --> 00:02:06,714
And the company that found it,

68
00:02:06,734 --> 00:02:09,139
Protogen, is about to test it on

69
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:11,059
everyone aboard Eros.

70
00:02:11,811 --> 00:02:13,841
Story three: Earth.

71
00:02:13,861 --> 00:02:16,591
Chrisjen Avasarala is a top United Nations

72
00:02:16,611 --> 00:02:19,886
official with sharp words and sharper instincts.

73
00:02:19,996 --> 00:02:21,351
She'll work with anyone,

74
00:02:21,371 --> 00:02:22,401
swear at anyone,

75
00:02:22,421 --> 00:02:25,151
and she's always thinking three moves ahead.

76
00:02:25,171 --> 00:02:27,251
While everyone else blames Mars or the

77
00:02:27,271 --> 00:02:29,726
Belt, she asks a better question:

78
00:02:29,746 --> 00:02:31,976
who actually gains from a war?

79
00:02:31,996 --> 00:02:33,701
She reaches out to Mars through an

80
00:02:33,721 --> 00:02:36,493
old friend, and the conspiracy pushes back.

81
00:02:37,247 --> 00:02:38,477
Following the money,

82
00:02:38,497 --> 00:02:40,802
Avasarala finds that the stealth ships were

83
00:02:40,822 --> 00:02:43,227
built in Earth's own shipyards for private

84
00:02:43,247 --> 00:02:44,602
contractors.

85
00:02:44,622 --> 00:02:46,427
The attacks on the Canterbury and the

86
00:02:46,447 --> 00:02:48,827
Donnager were designed to make Earth,

87
00:02:48,847 --> 00:02:51,377
Mars, and the Belt blame each other.

88
00:02:51,397 --> 00:02:53,977
The trail points to Jules-Pierre Mao,

89
00:02:53,997 --> 00:02:56,677
Julie's father, and to her own boss,

90
00:02:56,697 --> 00:02:58,402
Sadavir Errinwright.

91
00:02:58,422 --> 00:03:00,467
Someone on Earth wants this war.

92
00:03:01,204 --> 00:03:02,184
In the finale,

93
00:03:02,204 --> 00:03:04,694
Eros falls to the protomolecule,

94
00:03:04,714 --> 00:03:06,419
and Holden and Miller fight their way

95
00:03:06,439 --> 00:03:08,489
back to the Rocinante.

96
00:03:08,554 --> 00:03:10,469
The crew has become a family,

97
00:03:10,489 --> 00:03:11,994
Miller has a new purpose,

98
00:03:12,014 --> 00:03:14,819
and Avasarala knows who her enemies are.

99
00:03:14,839 --> 00:03:17,094
Three stories, one conspiracy,

100
00:03:17,114 --> 00:03:18,894
and a solar system that will never

101
00:03:18,914 --> 00:03:20,269
be the same.

102
00:03:20,289 --> 00:03:22,320
Next up: season two.

